eo tabpanel-media\" id=\"All\" class=\"awardItem ProductAwards__awardTab__yaTHJ ProductAwards__active__9TvSy\">\n          All\n      </li> <li aria-label=\"ROG Strix Scope NX TKL Deluxe Giải thưởng\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-controls=\"tabpanel-awards\" id=\"Giải_thưởng\" class=\"awardItem ProductAwards__awardTab__yaTHJ\" style=\"display:;\">\n          Giải thưởng\n      </li> <li aria-label=\"ROG Strix Scope NX TKL Deluxe Video review\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-controls=\"tabpanel-video\" id=\"Video_review\" class=\"awardItem ProductAwards__awardTab__yaTHJ\" style=\"display:;\">\n          Video review\n      </li> <li aria-label=\"ROG Strix Scope NX TKL Deluxe Media review\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-controls=\"tabpanel-media\" id=\"Media_review\" class=\"awardItem ProductAwards__awardTab__yaTHJ\" style=\"display:;\">\n          Media review\n      </li></ul></div> <div id=\"tabpanel-awards\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"Giải_thưởng\"><div class=\"ProductAward__productAwardPagePadding__dSaZj\"><div class=\"ProductAward__awardTitle__GUset\"><h2 class=\"pageAward vnRogFont ProductAward__vnRogFontSize__5eSiT\">\n        Giải thưởng \n      </h2> <span>(3)</span></div> <div class=\"ProductAward__mobileAwardContent__LNDCh\"><ul class=\"ProductAward__rewardContainer__sHbkR ProductAward__rewardItemLessThanThree__qeW8A\" style=\"width:100%;\"><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1323/202107091000190170436.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"HungryGeeks 100% Approved\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      HungryGeeks.ph\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>HungryGeeks 100% Approved</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      I have quite a respect for ASUS ROG keyboards as they are not only flashy but undoubtedly one of the best when it comes to comfort. Thankfully, the ROG Strix Scope has the same ROG DNA running in it. It has good spacing, high-quality keys, and the ROG NX Switches are actually good, just not mind-blowingly awesome). Suffice to say, this is one great keyboard if you want to go full-on ASUS.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>PHILIPPINES</span> <span>09/07/2021</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Strix Scope NX TKL Deluxe Media review Award of HungryGeeks 100% Approved\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://hungrygeeks.com.ph/rog-strix-scope-nx-tkl-deluxe-review-great-daily-driver/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1281/202303221814354050716.PNG\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Tecnologici.net Score\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      tecnologici.net\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Tecnologici.net Score</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      The keyboard offered by Asus is of excellent quality, featuring three connection options and able to offer very versatile use. Designed for gaming, thanks to its size it pushes hard on those who like first-person shooter games, offering more space for the mouse. Constructed of aluminum and plastic, the final rendering is very pleasing and makes good use of a very rich, but not the most intuitive software ever.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>ITALY</span> <span>03/21/2023</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Strix Scope NX TKL Deluxe Media review Award of Tecnologici.net Score\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.tecnologici.net/asus-rog-strix-scope-nx-tkl-wireless-deluxe-la-recensione/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/2004/202110290558224820142.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Silver award\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      Vladimir Pejic\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Silver award</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      So, apart from the fact that the DELUXE version that I found in the test has a different color, there is also the addition of a really nice and quality palm rest. However, this is also all that distinguishes these two editions so that the final rating for SCOPE NX TKL DELUXE does not deviate from the original for the Moonlight version - SILVER medal for quality and presentation!\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom